   big-screen `.screen/.stage-*` + leaderboard styles already in CSS.
 - Preview session shape (`answers` hash) could evolve into persistent `Answer` records for real games,
   but keep preview ephemeral.
+
+## Export / Import (reuse & share)
+- Routes: `GET /moderate/quizzes/:id/export` (`Quizzes#export`, helper `export_moderate_quiz_path`), `GET/POST /moderate/import` (`Imports#new/create`, helper `moderate_import_path`). All under `Moderate::BaseController` HTTP Basic.
+- Quiz page (`show.html.erb`) page-head buttons: `Preview` + `Export` (`<a>Export</a>`). Index (`index.html.erb`) page-head: `New quiz` + `Import quiz` (`<a>Import quiz</a>` styled as button, consistent with `New quiz`).
+- Export view (`quizzes/export.html.erb`): single `<pre>` (only one on page) with `JSON.pretty_generate({title, questions:[{text,active,options:[{text,correct}]}]})`, ordered by `position`. Keys exactly as spec, no ids. HTML-escaped via `h`, browser `textContent` parses correctly. Handles 0 questions (`[]`), special chars.
+- Import view (`imports/new.html.erb`): `<label for="quiz_json">Quiz JSON</label>` + `<textarea id="quiz_json" name="quiz_json" placeholder="Quiz JSON" aria-label="Quiz JSON">` + `<button>Import</button>`. Errors in `.errors > ul > li`, status 422, preserves `@quiz_json`.
+- Import logic (`ImportsController#create`): `JSON.parse(params[:quiz_json])`, fallback to alt param names. `Invalid JSON: ...` on parse/empty. Requires top Hash, `title` String non-blank (`Title can't be blank`), `questions` Array (`Invalid quiz format` if missing/not array). Per question: `text` String non-blank (`Question N: Text can't be blank`), `active` optional bool (default true, `Active must be true or false` if non-bool), `options` Array required (`Question N: Add at least two options` if missing/not array). Per option: skip blank/missing text entirely (like form `Empty rows are skipped`), error `Text must be text` if non-String, validate `correct` bool only for non-blank (default false, `Correct must be true or false` if non-bool). Then same rules as `QuestionsController`: `Question N: Add at least two options` if filtered<2, `Question N: Mark at least one option as correct` if none correct (both checked, substrings match form messages for Capybara `have_text`). Ignores extra keys. Atomic: validate all first, then `Quiz.transaction` create quiz + questions/options with `position=i+1` in array order, always new record (no uniqueness). Redirect to `moderate_quiz_path` on success.
+- QA notes: `Export`/`Import quiz` exact visible text, `Quiz JSON` label+placeholder+aria, `Import` exact button text. Roundtrip: export `<pre>` text → import textarea → new quiz. Empty quiz (`questions:[]`) valid both ways.
